# Independent pseudorandom values for procedural visual patterning.
#
# The 1,024 entries are independent draws from a seeded Mersenne Twister
# PRNG (Python's random.Random), not a low-discrepancy sequence — earlier
# revisions used a scrambled Sobol/Van der Corput table, which gives even
# coverage but reads as periodic rather than random when sampled in order.
# The seed 0xbd0bfc3921295b2a was generated once from the operating system
# CSPRNG. Keeping the decimals here makes every Starlark build reproducible
# while giving adjacent calls an independent-draw feel.

